---
import LegalLayout from '../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL, PRIVACY_PATH, SITE_BRAND } from '../../lib/seo';
---

<LegalLayout
	title="Cookie Policy"
	description="Cookies and local storage on StockVisual.com: sign-in, visual search, theme, and studio tools that do not track you."
	heading="Cookie Policy"
	lede="We use essential cookies to keep you signed in. Theme and studio work stay in the tab. We do not set ad-tracking cookies."
>
	<h2>1. What this page covers</h2>
	<p>
		{SITE_BRAND} uses cookies and similar storage so the live site can function: sign-in, Pro vs
		free downloads, and a few on-device preferences. How we handle personal data more broadly is in
		the <a href={PRIVACY_PATH}>Privacy Policy</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>2. Essential cookies</h2>
	<p>
		When you create an account or sign in, our authentication system (Better Auth) sets session
		cookies. These cookies are necessary to recognize you, protect the account, and apply 512 / 1K
		versus 2K / 4K / 8K access. Without them, signed-in features cannot work.
	</p>
	<p>
		We do not currently set advertising, social-media pixel, or cross-site tracking cookies, and we
		do not use cookies to sell a profile of you to third parties. Google Fonts, if loaded, may set
		cookies according to Google’s own policies when your browser requests those styles.
	</p>

	<h2>3. Local and session storage</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>
			<strong>Theme.</strong> Light or dark appearance is stored in local storage as
			<code>stockvisual-theme</code>. It never leaves your browser.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Privacy notice.</strong> After you tap “Got it”, we store
			<code>stockvisual-privacy-ok</code> as a first-party cookie and in local storage for 24
			hours so the notice does not repeat on that computer. The same window is also recorded
			against a hashed IP so another browser on that network is not shown the notice again that
			day.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Visual search.</strong> A query-photo reference may be kept in session storage so the
			search page can finish loading. If a photo is uploaded, it is stored on our side for about one
			hour and then deleted.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Studio tools.</strong> Convert, vectorize, social resize, watermark, palette, and the
			image editor may hold working images in memory or temporary browser storage for that tab.
			Closing the tab discards them. They are not sent to StockVisual.
		</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>4. Browser tools</h2>
	<p>
		The public studio at /tools/image, /tools/convert, /tools/vectorize, /tools/social,
		/tools/watermark, and /tools/palette processes files in your browser. They do not upload those
		files and they do not set extra analytics cookies for that processing.
	</p>

	<h2>5. How long they last</h2>
	<p>
		Session cookies last while you are signed in or until they expire or you sign out. Local-storage
		theme preference remains until you clear site data or change the theme. You can delete cookies
		and site storage in your browser settings; if you remove session cookies you will need to sign
		in again to use Pro sizes.
	</p>

	<h2>6. Your choices</h2>
	<p>
		Essential cookies are required for accounts. You can use the public library without an account
		and still download free 512 and 1K sizes. Blocking all cookies may break sign-in, plan-aware
		downloads, and some forms.
	</p>
	<p>
		Questions: <a href={`mailto:${LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
	</p>
</LegalLayout>
